  "prefLabel": "Bea 602.34 Unit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 602.34 “Unit” means a single-family residence, or a single-family residence within in a multi-family housing development, which includes a private kitchen and private bathroom.\n\nSource. #14044, eff 8-8-24",
